# Ptyxis (Ubuntu's default terminal) user palette, linked by dotbot into
# ~/.local/share/org.gnome.Ptyxis/palettes/. Same Darcula as
# terminal/ghostty.config and terminal/settings.json (orange in ANSI blue 4/12
# is the personal tweak). Ptyxis has no selection-colour key, so ghostty's
# selection-background has no counterpart here. Selecting it is per-profile
# dconf state, not a file: Ptyxis -> Preferences -> Palette, or
#   gsettings set org.gnome.Ptyxis.Profile:/org/gnome/Ptyxis/Profiles/<uuid>/ palette 'Darcula'
